WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,830
Then everyone still has to do it every day

2
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:01,920
Trap me into the fire

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,740
But your proposal is okay

4
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,100
Did you four hear that?

5
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,780
Xiao Qi is really not a human being

6
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:14,460
Is it acceptable if I give you 10%?

7
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:27,420
Then according to what Xiao Qi said, the four families will share 10% equally. Everyone will share Shaoyang equally and let Captain Lu go.

8
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:33,450
Xiao Qi just said that I will give you 30%, can you accept it?

9
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:35,090
Yang Zi, continue to cool

10
00:00:35,090 --> 00:00:36,090
Give Captain Lu 30%

11
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:37,570
By the way, keep two hundred tons

12
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:45,460
Captain Lu said that Captain Han who gave me a gift is now our turn, right? Xiao Qi

13
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:46,900
I think it’s inappropriate for you to be so divided
